---
/**
 * A sample plan used as a transparent stand-in for portfolio work.
 * It is a plan, not results: no performance numbers are shown.
 * Replace with real, client-approved work once available.
 */
---
<article class="sample" aria-labelledby="sample-title">
  <header class="sample-head">
    <div>
      <span class="badge badge--sample">Demonstration</span>
      <h3 id="sample-title">Sample plan: a local HVAC company</h3>
      <p class="muted">This is a made-up business used to show how we'd plan the work. It is not a client, and it shows no results.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="parts">
    <section>
      <h4>The goal</h4>
      <p>Get more summer service calls and keep the company visible in the community all year, within a monthly ad budget the owner sets.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h4>Facebook & Instagram ads</h4>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>A campaign for AC tune-ups and repairs, targeted to the service area</li>
        <li>Ads using the owner's real job photos</li>
        <li>A "send a message" or "call now" button</li>
        <li>New ad versions tested when results slow down</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h4>Social media content</h4>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>A monthly calendar agreed with the owner</li>
        <li>A mix of seasonal tips, finished jobs and current offers</li>
        <li>Branded graphics and captions in a consistent style</li>
        <li>Approved posts scheduled on Facebook and Instagram</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h4>What gets reported</h4>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Ad spend, reach and clicks</li>
        <li>Messages and calls from the ads</li>
        <li>What was posted and how people engaged</li>
        <li>What to change next month</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .sample { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; }
  .sample-head { padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper); }
  .sample-head div { display: grid; gap: .75rem; max-width: 42rem; }
  .parts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 15rem), 1fr)); }
  .parts section { padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem); display: grid; gap: .8rem; align-content: start; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); min-width: 0; }
  .parts p, .parts li { font-size: .95rem; }
</style>
